original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wXnP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3cb5d705-0cda-4295-b9c2-1ca78d337887","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"```goos: windows\ngoarch: amd64\npkg: \u003chttp://github.com/mattn/go-sandbox/go-strings-cut-benchmark|github.com/mattn/go-sandbox/go-strings-cut-benchmark\u003e\ncpu: AMD Ryzen 5 3500U with Radeon Vega Mobile Gfx\nBenchmarkCut-8          95441096                11.74 ns/op\nBenchmarkSplitN-8       10037221                99.67 ns/op\nPASS\nok      \u003chttp://github.com/mattn/go-sandbox/go-strings-cut-benchmark|github.com/mattn/go-sandbox/go-strings-cut-benchmark\u003e    2.349s```","ts":"1633587457.221600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OQPuW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"039ffac8-9983-49e7-87eb-2e7b5bde4bc6","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"SplitN でやるべきだった。","ts":"1633587425.221400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"skP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8331d936-f012-47ab-9383-b989769af183","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"```package main_test\n\nimport (\n\t\"strings\"\n\t\"testing\"\n)\n\nfunc BenchmarkCut(b *testing.B) {\n\ts := \"foo:bar\"\n\tb.ResetTimer()\n\tfor i := 0; i \u0026lt; b.N; i++ {\n\t\tlhs, rhs, ok := strings.Cut(s, \":\")\n\t\tif !ok || lhs != \"foo\" || rhs != \"bar\" {\n\t\t\tb.Fatal(\"bad!\")\n\t\t}\n\t}\n}\n\nfunc BenchmarkSplit(b *testing.B) {\n\ts := \"foo:bar\"\n\tb.ResetTimer()\n\tfor i := 0; i \u0026lt; b.N; i++ {\n\t\ttok := strings.Split(s, \":\")\n\t\tif len(tok) != 2 || tok[0] != \"foo\" || tok[1] != \"bar\" {\n\t\t\tb.Fatal(\"bad!\")\n\t\t}\n\t}\n}```\n```goos: windows\ngoarch: amd64\npkg: \u003chttp://github.com/mattn/go-sandbox/go-strings-cut-benchmark|github.com/mattn/go-sandbox/go-strings-cut-benchmark\u003e\ncpu: AMD Ryzen 5 3500U with Radeon Vega Mobile Gfx\nBenchmarkCut-8          110818268               10.31 ns/op\nBenchmarkSplit-8        12363765               106.0 ns/op\nPASS\nok      \u003chttp://github.com/mattn/go-sandbox/go-strings-cut-benchmark|github.com/mattn/go-sandbox/go-strings-cut-benchmark\u003e    3.506s```","ts":"1633587394.221000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"npTS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"da7ad435-3abf-4c5b-8c25-7d15109e357b","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"Indexの用途の70%が `{name}{SEP}{value}` という文字列から `{name}` と `{value}` を切り出すために使われてるから(数字の根拠はわからない)、だったら専用の用意したほうが良いよねって話。\n\nまぁ手元のソースをちょっと眺めてみると、確かにそういうケースが多い。SplitNは未検証だけど。","ts":"1633587025.220500","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1633587056.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/lXU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"49bd9e1a-5649-4473-9713-a3ddf41912a7","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"あ、ぼくが Cut のインタフェースを誤解していた。","ts":"1633586856.218200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WM9N"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e11a8ed8-181b-4756-9572-98a806a28fd0","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"あとは X-Forwareded のパーサーもあるけど…これはちょっと出すのが面倒だな。","ts":"1633586759.217900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4gxt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"84665d03-8733-4d32-9d21-99c912a678a4","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ちなみにこの例は `grep -nr '\\(strings\\|bytes\\)\\.Index'` で探した。","ts":"1633586678.217400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"561XI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"febeb910-bb74-46f4-a378-98792f15e5dc","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"それがこんな風に簡略化にはなるかなと。","ts":"1633586648.216800","files":[{"id":"F02HNFTS280","created":1633586647,"timestamp":1633586647,"name":"Untitled.txt","title":"Untitled","mimetype"